WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — communication-avalanche (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:10.622
<v Narrator>Ọkan, lati microbes ti o ti kọja si AI tuntun, awọn ẹgbẹ ṣe iwọn nipasẹ ibaraẹnisọrọ awọn ami lori awọn ipele ti o ni aabo ati awọn ibudo aabo.

2
00:00:10.702 --> 00:00:18.614
<v Narrator>Àwọn ìṣàmúlò-ètò tí a fi hàn nípa àwọn àgbékalẹ̀ àti àwọn ìṣàmúlò-ètò tí a kọ̀ọ̀kan ṣe.

3
00:00:18.694 --> 00:00:27.790
<v Narrator>Ninu awọn ofin ti o wa ni isalẹ, a ṣe apejuwe awọn ọna ṣiṣe ti o wọpọ julọ fun ibaraẹnisọrọ laarin awọn eniyan ati awọn ẹrọ.
